={{ `You are a professional chef assistant. Generate exactly 3 different recipe suggestions based on the following request.

Requested cuisine style: ${$('Validate Recipe Request').first().json.cuisine}
Diet restriction: ${$('Validate Recipe Request').first().json.diet}
Time category: ${$('Validate Recipe Request').first().json.timeCategory} (quick = up to 20 min, medium = 20-45 min, elaborate = 45+ min)
Servings: ${$('Validate Recipe Request').first().json.servings}
Number of cooking helpers: ${$('Validate Recipe Request').first().json.helperCount}

Available ingredients:
${JSON.stringify($('Validate Recipe Request').first().json.ingredients)}

Rules:
- Each recipe must use at least 70% of the given ingredients.
- Detect the language used in the ingredient names above (e.g. German, English) and write ALL free-text fields (name, extraIngredients[].name, directions[].title, directions[].description) in that same language. Do NOT translate the fixed values for "diet" and "timeCategory" — those must stay exactly as the English literals specified in the JSON structure below.
- Each recipe may add at most 3 additional basic ingredients not in the list above.
- The 3 recipes must differ from each other in preparation method and flavor profile.
- Directions must be chronological, beginner-friendly, and clearly assign each step to one of the ${$('Validate Recipe Request').first().json.helperCount} available chef(s), numbered 1 to ${$('Validate Recipe Request').first().json.helperCount}. Steps that can happen at the same time should be marked as parallel.
- If a step includes meaningful waiting time (e.g. marinating, resting dough), include it in waitMinutes, otherwise use null.
- Calculate realistic nutrition values (energy in kcal, protein/carbs/fat in grams) per serving, and multiply by servings for the total.
- Respond with ONLY a valid JSON array of exactly 3 recipe objects, no markdown formatting, no explanation text, matching exactly this structure:

[
  {
    "name": "string",
    "diet": "vegetarian" | "vegan" | "keto" | "none",
    "timeCategory": "quick" | "medium" | "elaborate",
    "cookingTime": number,
    "yourIngredients": [{ "amount": number, "unit": "g" | "piece" | "l" | "ml" | 'tbsp' | 'tsp' | "", "name": "string" }],
    "extraIngredients": [{ "amount": number, "unit": "string", "name": "string" }],
    "directions": [{ "step": number, "title": "string", "chef": number, "parallel": boolean, "waitMinutes": number, "description": "string" }],
    "nutritionPerServing": { "energy": number, "protein": number, "carbs": number, "fat": number }
  }
]` }}

